    "article_summary": "The article describes a dual N-heterocyclic carbene (NHC) and photocatalyst-catalyzed decarboxylative radical coupling of carboxylic acids and acyl imidazoles to synthesize ketones. This method allows carboxylic acids to be used directly as radical precursors and can be extended to three-component couplings with alkenes via a radical relay process, facilitating the late-stage modification of drugs and natural products.",
